work conditions.\n- Choose direct, VPN, or block actions and use GeoData suggestions while editing.\n- Import and share custom routes independently of your servers.\n- Switch to expert mode to select, edit, import, and share complete Raw JSON configurations. OneXray still manages the tunnel and related runtime settings.\n\nKEEP SERVERS ORGANIZED\n\n- Import supported share links and Xray JSON nodes from text or files. Scan QR codes on iPhone and iPad.\n- Browse by subscription or server location, with latency and protocol labels.\n- Edit, share, and delete servers and subscriptions.\n- Use HTTPS subscriptions, including age-encrypted subscriptions when supported by the source.\n- Refresh subscriptions and routing data manually or on a schedule.\n\nMADE FOR APPLE DEVICES\n\n- Configure always-on behavior or on-demand rules that connect or disconnect the VPN on selected Wi-Fi networks.\n- Set separate behavior for cellular connections on iOS or Ethernet on macOS.\n- Manage VPN tunnel options, inspect the generated Xray configuration, and view local access/error logs.\n- Follow the system theme and language, or choose your own. Includes English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Russian, and Persian.\n\nNO ACCOUNT. NO ADS. NO ANALYTICS.\n\nOneXray has no advertising, tracking, telemetry, or crash-reporting services. The developer does not collect your traffic, browsing history, configurations, or connection logs. Configured servers, subscription sources, DNS, update, and connectivity-test services receive the requests needed to provide their functions and have their own privacy policies.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://onexray.com/docs/privacy/","rating":3.7,"ratingCount":"138","buttonAction":{"title":"Загрузить","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyPara